{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026o3yJhqmfxS1793242565.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有市場人士指，港股於期指結算日，很大機會企穩23,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人彭偉新說︰「通常來說，結算日除非有很大變動，否則也是繼續維持在前一段時間內徘徊。現時來說暫時看23,000點位置，暫且是短期支持，心理關口應可企穩。外圍也沒甚麼特別事情發生，很大機會貼近23,000點水平結算。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:00.979976+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:20.388202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:24.076344+00:00","content_hash":"dce9b06d04d0a013950f4e2523e89aa21b44f28f9505e8c0dd4b8f85cdb7b634","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:00.979976+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}